```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.bag.registers ~ the operator's repo registry: an id maps to a root only this vessel knows

A bag that homes at a repository names a REGISTERED id; the operator maps ids to roots once, on their own vessel, so a declaration stays portable and the path stays local. `repo list` (the default) prints the registry, `repo add <id> --root <path> [--vcs git|other]` registers one (`--vcs` defaults to git), and `repo drop <id>` removes one: bags naming it keep their declaration and simply stop resolving here. An unregistered id refuses rather than resolving somewhere convenient.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list · add · drop

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`op/list ~ print every registered repo`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`add` params=`op/add id/lares-repo root/./checkouts/lares ~ register an id at a root on this vessel`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`drop` params=`op/drop id/lares-repo ~ remove the id; bags naming it stop resolving here`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ op · id · root · vcs

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`op` params=`takes/list-add-drop seat/1 as/<op> ~ the registry operation; absent, list`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`id` params=`takes/repo-id seat/2 as/<id> ~ the repo id an add or a drop names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`root` params=`takes/path ~ the checkout root an add registers; it never leaves this vessel`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`vcs` params=`takes/git-or-other ~ the repo's version control; default git`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a local write of the registry beside the vessel's config; a list writes nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · op-unknown

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.bag.registers op/add id/<id> root/<path>]] ~ an add wants the id and --root; a drop wants the id`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`op-unknown` params=`cure/[[carriage.bag.registers op/list]] ~ the registry takes list, add or drop`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed · changed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[path repos]] ~ every registered repo with its vcs and root`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`changed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[id root vcs count]] ~ the registry after an add or a drop`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares bag repo

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares bag repo]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

